{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51644","headline":"题画 · 唐希雅","name":"题画","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁泼烟云六尺绡，寒山秋树晚萧萧。\n十年来往吴淞口，错认溪南旧板桥。\n（《全五代诗》三六引《槜李诗系》）（〖1〗见《槜李诗系》卷一。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐希雅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}